%T A387851 112,176,196,270,298,408,423,640,840,1096,1216,1484,1768,2074,2624,
%U A387851 3450,4323
%N A387851 Largest Littlewood-Richardson coefficient of symmetric group S_n of degree n.
%C A387851 a(n) is the largest Littlewood-Richardson coefficient c^lambda_{mu,nu} where |lambda|=n.
%H A387851 Igor Pak, Greta Panova, and Damir Yeliussizov, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcta.2019.01.008">On the largest Kronecker and Littlewood-Richardson coefficients</a>, J. Combin. Theory Ser. A. 165 (2019), 44-77, Appendix A.
%H A387851 Igor Pak, Greta Panova, and Damir Yeliussizov, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.04693">On the largest Kronecker and Littlewood-Richardson coefficients</a>, arXiv:1804.04693 [math.CO], 2018.
%F A387851 a(n) = 2^(n/2 + O(sqrt(n))).
%e A387851 For n=6 the a(6) = 2 because the maximum is attained at c^{321}_{21,21}=2.
%Y A387851 Cf. A003040, A129723.
